{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792893725.4, "seq": 34, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.00050604, "parents": ["Z10"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "progress", "call"], ["progress", "goal_field", "call"]], "n_edges": 2, "editable": ["s1", "s3", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 707, "out": 762, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 3.4, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "This mutation changes `progress` so a carrying champion avoids enemy champions even when healthy, not only when hurt. `goal_field` and `score` are unchanged.\n\n```python\n@gene(\"s4\", \"how much closer a step brings me to the goals, minus danger from enemy champions (stronger when hurt or carrying gems)\", parents=[\"s4\"])\ndef progress(t: Tile) -> Num:\n    f = goal_field()\n    p = at(f, me().pos) - at(f, t)\n    near = sum(1 for u in enemies() if u.is_champion and dist(u.pos, t) <= 2)\n    if me().health_frac < 0.5:\n        p -= 3 * near\n    elif gems() > 0:\n        p -= 2 * near\n    return p\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: progress line 64: cannot assign to near", "birth": 11, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
